#: matesla/forms.py:65
msgid ""
"Paste a domain (example.com), an origin (https://example.com), or the full "
"public-key URL. Hosting is free choice (nginx, S3, Cloudflare, GitHub Pages,"
" …) but Tesla always fetches /.well-known/appspecific/com.tesla.3p.public-"
"key.pem on that host. Add the same host with https:// as Allowed Origin on "
"developer.tesla.com. Not localhost."
msgstr ""
"Collez un domaine (example.com), une origine (https://example.com) ou l’URL "
"complète de la clé publique. L’hébergement est libre (nginx, S3, Cloudflare,"
" GitHub Pages, …) mais Tesla récupère toujours /.well-"
"known/appspecific/com.tesla.3p.public-key.pem sur cet hôte. Ajoutez le même "
"hôte avec https:// en Allowed Origin sur developer.tesla.com. Pas localhost."

